<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aukland details rights offer.</title>
<headline>Aukland details rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African healthcare firm Aukland Investments Ltd said it was proceeding with a rights offer to facilitate the investment of the Pamodzi Consortium.</p>
<p>The issue, intended to raise 71.6 million rand, would be in the ratio of 65 shares for every 100 ordinary shares held, and a total of 17.9 million news shares would be issued, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The last day to register for the rights offer would be July 11, 1997.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom -27-11-482.1003</p>
</text>
